1
00:00:00,950 --> 00:00:03,920
Oh. Lucy's free after all, see you.

2
00:00:05,021 --> 00:00:07,781
No, no, no, hey, hey, hey,
you can't leave, we just started.

3
00:00:08,024 --> 00:00:11,824
(Raj:)You're right, I should finish the game.
I take my plus-one long sword...

4
00:00:12,061 --> 00:00:15,891
(Raj:)...stab myself in the face with it.
I'm dead, I've got a date with a girl. Bye.

5
00:00:17,967 --> 00:00:18,987
(Howard:)We'll be fine. Watch.

6
00:00:19,168 --> 00:00:25,598
Ahem. Suddenly, a spectral shape rises from
Koothrappali's bloody corpse and says:

7
00:00:25,808 --> 00:00:30,908
"Don't worry, buddies. Ghost
Raj will help guide you through the forest."

8
00:00:33,483 --> 00:00:37,443
(Howard:)I'm just a tree,
but if I were you, I'd listen to your ghost friend.

9
00:00:41,758 --> 00:00:43,788
(Sheldon:)Go on. Give him your lunch money.

10
00:00:48,931 --> 00:00:51,021
(Raj:)I'm very happy you were able to hang out.

11
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:52,500
(Lucy:)Me too.

12
00:00:52,702 --> 00:00:56,362
(Raj:)Not that it's up to you to make me happy.
Unless you find neediness sexy...

13
00:00:56,606 --> 00:01:02,026
...in which case you're with
the hottest man on the planet. Heh.

